cument_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029773006:0":{"text":"相关的单据我已经提交给了骑士团，当然，也有你亲自与之联络的负责人——现在是我们的证人了。","source_cn":"相关的单据我已经提交给了骑士团，当然，也有你亲自与之联...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28B68CC93E1BE519","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029773007:0":{"text":"这、这、这点事骑士团不会管的吧，只是些生意上的——","source_cn":"这、这、这点事骑士团不会管的吧，只是些生意上的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A1408004A91E995","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029773008:1":{"text":"啊，没错——虽然骑士团通常不会负责贪污、吃回扣以及偷工减料这些贵商会的内部事务……","source_cn":"啊，没错——虽然骑士团通常不会负责贪污、吃回扣以及偷工...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x853C1D9C823EDF6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029773009:1":{"text":"但数次买凶杀人，对象不仅是一位知名的绅士，更是公主殿下的未来伴侣，这可就不能置之不理了。","source_cn":"但数次买凶杀人，对象不仅是一位知名的绅士，更是公主殿下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAC43AABEB1A3569","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029773010:1":{"text":"哦，捎带一提，你雇佣的佣兵，提供的运输，甚至连武器的供应方，我们都已经掌控了。","source_cn":"哦，捎带一提，你雇佣的佣兵，提供的运输，甚至连武器的供...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A664462E95A0EE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_f